OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,BSheehan out of Wallabies Test after    
OL,5,Btwo-game ban                           
OL,6,GIreland's stand-in captain Dan Sheehan 
OL,7,Ghas been banned for two games after a  
OL,8,Gcroc-roll tackle against South Africa  
OL,9,Gand will play no part against          
OL,10,GAustralia on Friday night.             
OL,12,FThe Leinster forward was shown a       
OL,13,Fyellow card by referee Christophe      
OL,14,FRidley in the 72nd minute of Ireland's 
OL,15,F20-17 victory over the Springboks in   
OL,16,FDublin on Saturday.                    
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
