OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,BGlens boss Ferguson apologises after   
OL,5,Bseven-game ban                         
OL,6,GGlentoran manager Duncan Ferguson has  
OL,7,Gbeen suspended for seven games         
OL,8,Gfollowing his red card in the side's 3-
OL,9,G2 defeat by Cliftonville last week.    
OL,11,FThe former Everton striker was         
OL,12,Fdismissed for how he addressed match   
OL,13,Fofficials after believing the Reds'    
OL,14,Fopener at Solitude should have been    
OL,15,Fruled out for a foul in the build-up.  
OL,17,FThe 1995 FA Cup winner arrived at the  
OL,18,FOval in October and has so far won     
OL,19,Fone, drawn two and lost one of his     
OL,20,Ffour games in charge.                  
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
