OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,BO'Toole relishing role on Ireland's    
OL,5,B'Tom Squad'                            
OL,6,GWith Ireland's win over the Springboks 
OL,7,Gon Saturday hanging in the balance     
OL,8,Guntil the final whistle, Andy          
OL,9,GFarrell's bench had to play a          
OL,10,Gconsiderable part in getting the 20-17 
OL,11,Gsuccess over the line.                 
OL,13,FGiven South Africa's fearsome scrum, a 
OL,14,Fset-piece in the shadow of their own   
OL,15,Fposts was among the most nervy moments 
OL,16,Fof a frantic endgame.                  
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
