OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,BO'Donnell explains his vision for      
OL,5,Bsuccess at Derry                       
OL,6,GAs the latest manager tasked with      
OL,7,Gtrying to end Derry City's decades-    
OL,8,Glong wait to reclaim the premier prize 
OL,9,Gin League of Ireland football, new     
OL,10,GCandystripes manager Stephen O'Donnell 
OL,11,Ghas laid out what he believes can be a 
OL,12,Grecipe for success at the Brandywell   
OL,13,Gclub.                                  
OL,15,FDerry last landed the Premier Division 
OL,16,Ftitle in 1997 and while knockout       
OL,17,Ftriumphs such as this year's FAI Cup   
OL,18,Ffinal victory have been celebrated by  
OL,19,Fthe club's supporters, it is a league  
OL,20,Fchampionship that fans of the club     
OL,21,Fcrave most.                            
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
